  "bio": "Rafael Grilo, based in Sao Paulo, Brazil, is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in lettering and tribal styles. With an impressive proficiency in 'Calligraffiti' and a keen eye for the nuanced shades of 'Preto e cinza,' Rafael's work often pays homage to the vibrancy of hip-hop and the art of graffiti. Clients consistently laud his cleanliness, ensuring a safe and hygienic environment for every session.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Sao Paulo, Sao Paulo, Brazil",
